      "title": "Verbatim Playbook & Todo Binding",
      "items": [
        "Playbook steps copy verbatim into todo tool before execution",
        "Skips stay explicit with 'skip: <reason>' rather than disappearing",
        "Non-standard or cross-cutting tasks route to figure-it-out"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Strict Task Verification on Surface",
      "items": [
        "Unit test green alone is insufficient without real artifact verification",
        "Web and Electron UIs drive through the browser tool",
        "CLIs and TUIs run via interactive hub PTY processes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Tiered Delegation & Model Roles",
      "items": [
        "Code tasks delegate to pstack-code or pstack-judgment roles",
        "Session owner reviews all diffs and sweeps slop with no-comments",
